WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.837
Let’s walk through Complete the observation loop.

00:00:02.837 --> 00:00:05.975
Use the formal artifact and your observation record as two

00:00:05.975 --> 00:00:07.700
complementary views.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:10.075
The artifact states what the team decided;

00:00:10.075 --> 00:00:13.425
your notes should explain the sequence, influence, friction

00:00:13.425 --> 00:00:15.713
, and turning points that produced it.

00:00:15.713 --> 00:00:18.525
On this slide, before the move closes, verify

00:00:18.525 --> 00:00:21.863
that decisive moments, dynamics, alliances, and the

00:00:21.863 --> 00:00:24.613
formal artifact tell a coherent story.

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:28.085
In practice, the Notetaker explains the process;

00:00:28.085 --> 00:00:31.172
the Scribe owns the team artifact, the Facilitator owns

00:00:31.172 --> 00:00:34.797
final handoff, and White Cell owns adjudication.

00:00:34.797 --> 00:00:37.360
Before you continue, verify these points:

00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:40.297
Prefer specific observations over judgments.

00:00:40.297 --> 00:00:42.648
Preserve separate seat perspectives.

00:00:42.648 --> 00:00:45.985
Start Here remains available above the session label.

00:00:45.985 --> 00:00:49.510
Use the highlighted Session reference area as your visual reference

00:00:49.510 --> 00:00:51.185
while you complete this check.
